釣名。且臣聞管仲相齊，有三歸，侈擬於君，桓公以霸，亦上僭於君。晏嬰相景公，食不重肉，妾不衣絲，齊國亦治，此下比於民。今臣弘位為御史大夫，而為布被，自九卿以下至於小吏，無差，誠如汲黯言。且無汲黯忠，陛下安得聞此言。」天子以為謙讓，愈益厚之。卒以弘為丞相，封平津侯。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji112-013:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p006","start":108,"end":109,"surface":"相","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0106","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"原文稱號與事件分存，未知端點不補造；死亡不自動終止官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p006","text":"汲黯曰：「弘位在三公，奉祿甚多。然為布被，此詐也。」上問弘。弘謝曰：「有之。夫九卿與臣善者無過黯，然今日庭詰弘，誠中弘之病。夫以三公為布被，誠飾詐欲以釣名。且臣聞管仲相齊，有三歸，侈擬於君，桓公以霸，亦上僭於君。晏嬰相景公，食不重肉，妾不衣絲，齊國亦治，此下比於民。今臣弘位為御史大夫，而為布被，自九卿以下至於小吏，無差，誠如汲黯言。且無汲黯忠，陛下安得聞此言。」天子以為謙讓，愈益厚之。卒以弘為丞相，封平津侯。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"汲黯","kind":"person","person_id":"fmh_dmt_cql","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"a05_brz_8xe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m006-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"黯","kind":"person","person_id":"fmh_dmt_cql","status":"contextual_provis